nd Guy can trump his fears and triumph over his pain. He needs your help.", "summary": "Niinamigota is a sad, heartfelt, story rich, JRPG adventure of Island guy and his heroic quest to return home. Visit the Island and Fix the S.S. Stockhausen. Help the lost islanders and learn of the mystery snowmen! Solely built with RPG Maker 2003. Don't Forget Island Girl and Samuel!", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/niinamigota", "videos": [{"id": 152541, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5vzbsDkJAZw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5vzbsDkJAZw", "title": "Niinamigota [Island Fun] ---  Official Trailer [2020]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5vzbsDkJAZw/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}